OL,3,CMan, 102, dies after alleged assault
OL,4,Cat Cwmbran pub
OL,6,FA 102 year-old man has died after
OL,7,Fallegedly being assaulted at a pub in
OL,8,FCwmbran, south Wales.
OL,10,FPhillip Ormerod, from Cwmbran, was
OL,11,Ftaken to hospital in a critical
OL,12,Fcondition on 1 August following an
OL,13,Fincident at the Crow's Nest pub on
OL,14,FLlangorse Road.
OL,16,FA 56-year-old man from Llanelli was
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of section 20
OL,18,Fassault and remains released under
OL,19,Finvestigation while enquiries continue.
