OL,3,CMan, 102, dies after alleged assault
OL,4,Cat Cwmbran pub
OL,6,FSenior Investigating Officer, DCI
OL,7,FShelley Comley said: "We understand
OL,8,Fthe public interest in this incident
OL,9,Fbut want to remind people that not
OL,10,Fonly is this an active criminal
OL,11,Finvestigation but there is a family at
OL,12,Fheart of it processing the loss of a
OL,13,Floved one.
OL,15,F"Please consider the impact that
OL,16,Finaccurate or speculative comments,
OL,17,Fparticularly online commentary, could
OL,18,Fhave on them and the ongoing
OL,19,Finvestigation as a whole."
